                <h1 id="web-design-your-ring">Web · Design Your Ring</h1>

    <p>Flow: choose ring → choose size → choose stone → preview → add to cart. Metal and karat come with the ring.</p>

                                <h2 id="web-design-your-ring-GETapi-v1-web-configurator">Configurator data</h2>

