                    <h2 id="web-design-your-ring-POSTapi-v1-web-configurator-price">Price a ring + stone</h2>

<p>
</p>

<p>Full breakdown: gold value, craft fee, ring charge, stone price, total and the gold rate used.
Ring size does not change the price; it is only validated.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-v1-web-configurator-price">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/web/configurator/price" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --header "X-Currency: EUR" \
    --data "{
    \"ring_id\": 1,
    \"stone_id\": 1,
    \"size\": \"6.5\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/web/configurator/price"
);

const headers = {
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
    "X-Currency": "EUR",
};

let body = {
    "ring_id": 1,
    "stone_id": 1,
    "size": "6.5"
};

fetch(url, {
    method: "POST",
    headers,
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre></div>

