                <h1 id="web-cart">Web · Cart</h1>

    <p>The cart lives on the client. This endpoint prices it; it never trusts client prices.</p>

                                <h2 id="web-cart-POSTapi-v1-web-cart-quote">Quote a cart</h2>

<p>
</p>

<p>Public (guests can price a cart). With a Bearer token, per-customer coupon limits are checked too.
Line errors: <code>not_found</code>, <code>inactive</code>, <code>out_of_stock</code>, <code>invalid_size</code>, <code>combo_unavailable</code>.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-v1-web-cart-quote">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/web/cart/quote" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --header "X-Currency: EUR" \
    --data "{
    \"items\": [
        {
            \"type\": \"product\",
            \"product_id\": 1,
            \"ring_id\": 1,
            \"stone_id\": 1,
            \"size\": \"7\",
