                    <h2 id="web-auth-POSTapi-v1-web-auth-forgot-password">Forgot password</h2>

<p>
</p>

<p>Emails a 6-digit code (valid 15 minutes). Always returns the same generic message.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-v1-web-auth-forgot-password">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/web/auth/forgot-password" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --header "X-Currency: EUR" \
    --data "{
    \"email\": \"demo@aanigems.com\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/web/auth/forgot-password"
);

