                <h1 id="mobile-store">Mobile · Store</h1>

    <p>Public store data: bootstrap and home. Send <code>X-Currency</code> (EUR, USD, INR, AED, GBP) to get prices in that currency.</p>

                                <h2 id="mobile-store-GETapi-v1-mobile-bootstrap">Bootstrap</h2>

<p>
</p>

